      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "The attacks were in support of coca leaf growers who staged demonstrations."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "How can you expect people who never respected our drug laws to enforce them now?"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Who is the boy that swims in the pool?"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He is the best friend that I have."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "He is the only boy that I can trust."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Citizens captured a sex offender whose schemes authorities did not take seriously."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "It is certain that we can not do it."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "The fact that he stole the money can not be denied."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Do you know what your daughter did to him?"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "This is what she did."
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I think I know who did it."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Whatever he buys is interesting."
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Whatever book he buys is interesting."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "You may choose whichever you like."
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You may choose whichever book you like."
        }
      ]
    },
